                "t": "p",
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "t": "strong",
                    "v": "Practical Recording Demonstration"
                  },
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": ": Shows running the video recording script and operating it through a remote desktop."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "p",
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "t": "strong",
                    "v": "Video Playback"
                  },
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": ": Illustrates locating and playing back recorded videos to check quality."
